@startuml
title 图5-2 商品管理模块 B 端商品新增时序图

skinparam shadowing false

actor 管理员 as A
participant "管理后台" as ADM
participant "ClGoodsController" as C
participant "IClGoodsService" as S
participant "ClGoodsMapper" as G
participant "ClGoodsExtendMapper" as E
database "MySQL" as DB

A -> ADM : 填写商品表单并提交
ADM -> C : POST /cl/goods
C -> C : 参数校验\n(名称/价格/库存)
C -> S : insertClGoods(goods)
S -> G : insertClGoods
G -> DB : INSERT cl_goods
DB --> G : goods_id
G --> S : 主键

alt goodsType = "1" 定制商品
  S -> E : insertClGoodsExtend(extend)
  E -> DB : INSERT cl_goods_extend
  DB --> E : OK
  E --> S : OK
end

S --> C : 成功/失败
C --> ADM : AjaxResult
ADM --> A : 提示并刷新列表

note over S, DB
  主表与扩展表写入
  在同一事务中提交，
  任一步失败则回滚。
end note

@enduml
